### File: .\Enable-SharedMailboxSentItemCopy.ps1

Save copy of Sent and Sent-on-Behalf items of Shared Mailbox

Run these commands before you run the script

>>> Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Force
>>> Get-ChildItem "C:\Program Files\WindowsPowerShell\Modules\ExchangeOnlineManagement" -Recurse | Unblock-File

And then run the script

>>> .\Enable-SharedMailboxSentItemCopy.ps1 -AdminEmail "admin@company.com" -MailboxEmail "shared@company.com"

Note: It take some time for the authentication to go through or it might seem stuck on the power shell, press Enter, or Ctrl + C on the power shell after the authentication popup has closed itself.

